{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00394",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.05,
      "end_seconds": 5.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Good evening, doctor, thank you for staying late."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.41,
      "end_seconds": 10.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.66,
      "end_seconds": 14.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.86,
      "end_seconds": 18.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.28,
      "end_seconds": 26.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "it's headaches for a while. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.12,
      "end_seconds": 33.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "How long have you had it? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.18,
      "end_seconds": 39.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "it's, It's been going on for two days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.44,
      "end_seconds": 50.89,
      "duration_seconds": 10.45,
      "text": "tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.8,
      "end_seconds": 61.25,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "It happens once or twice a day. Mild, really. Oh, and occasional nausea. That's been about the same, four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.17,
      "end_seconds": 64.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Have you had blurry vision at times?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.45,
      "end_seconds": 67.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Yes, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.02,
      "end_seconds": 71.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "How bad is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.07,
      "end_seconds": 79.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "Maybe a five out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.57,
      "end_seconds": 87.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "have you had headaches for a while before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.28,
      "end_seconds": 92.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "a bit, last winter it settled by itself back then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.1,
      "end_seconds": 103.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.11,
      "end_seconds": 108.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.14,
      "end_seconds": 111.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "Right, right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.95,
      "end_seconds": 129.24,
      "duration_seconds": 16.29,
      "text": "I have an irregular heartbeat, for nearly five years. I have arthritis in my knees, for two years. I thought it it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.68,
      "end_seconds": 131.55,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "Anything more?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.13,
      "end_seconds": 142.47,
      "duration_seconds": 10.34,
      "text": "Okay, I can see an irregular heartbeat in your file as well. What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.44,
      "end_seconds": 147.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "My father had kidney stones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.05,
      "end_seconds": 150.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.1,
      "end_seconds": 156.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Just cataract surgery on my right eye, last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.28,
      "end_seconds": 162.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "are there any allergies on your record that I should check?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.94,
      "end_seconds": 168.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Yes, latex. I get a rash on my hands."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.05,
      "end_seconds": 176.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "tell me about your routine, work, habits, that that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.42,
      "end_seconds": 192.34,
      "duration_seconds": 14.92,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest. I've never smoked. I cycle to work most mornings. I drive a delivery van all day. I stay with my daughter and her family."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.09,
      "end_seconds": 197.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.62,
      "end_seconds": 201.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "It's ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 203.24,
      "end_seconds": 208.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the the last visit lists it as 10 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.21,
      "end_seconds": 212.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "I see is the most recent prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.61,
      "end_seconds": 216.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "No, I left it at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.5,
      "end_seconds": 231.42,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "Any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.34,
      "end_seconds": 234.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "definitely no fever"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.58,
      "end_seconds": 241.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "A few quick ones: seizures, jaw pain on chewing, confusion or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.93,
      "end_seconds": 244.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.88,
      "end_seconds": 248.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.82,
      "end_seconds": 250.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "breathing's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 261.9,
      "end_seconds": 269.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Pulse 65, temp 36.6 degrees, respiratory rate 15, pressure 123 over 81."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.78,
      "end_seconds": 272.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.75,
      "end_seconds": 278.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Right, let me check a a few things physically."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.77,
      "end_seconds": 282.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "just relax, I'll be quick"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.5,
      "end_seconds": 298.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "visual fields are full to confrontation and the optic discs look normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.32,
      "end_seconds": 301.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "bear with me a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.95,
      "end_seconds": 322.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "power and reflexes are equal on both sides"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.45,
      "end_seconds": 347.48,
      "duration_seconds": 23.03,
      "text": "Thanks for that. So where does that leave us? The most likely explanation is a headache disorder of uncertain type. Another possibility is tension-type headache. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've had headaches for a while for two days, mild, and no confusion or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 348.22,
      "end_seconds": 349.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.76,
      "end_seconds": 372.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an eye pressure check for headache with blurred vision"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.41,
      "end_seconds": 374.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 375.45,
      "end_seconds": 398.38,
      "duration_seconds": 22.93,
      "text": "We should do an MRI of the brain for headaches with visual symptoms. Note down each headache with the date, time and what you were doing. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 401.89,
      "end_seconds": 403.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Okay, I'll remember."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 404.43,
      "end_seconds": 408.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Come back in four weeks. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 409.99,
      "end_seconds": 411.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "okay, thank you bye"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 413.07,
      "end_seconds": 414.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}